{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2019-12", "window": 4, "start_date": 1577145600, "end_date": 1577836799, "month_true_total": 148, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:57:56 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "61007864", "author": {"steamid": "76561198400293249", "personaname": "Jakob", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/raD13/", "num_games_owned": 175, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 614, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 273, "last_played": 1598063032, "avatar": "e823b6ddd49cf4658b88d37d345a6071c561f8c3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good, this game kicks a lot of orc ass (literally) and still looks good to this day.\n\nHowever, the audio I have a problem with, the voices are very quiet I sometime's have to turn up my computer or lower the music just to hear what they're saying\n\nOther than that, the game is good but very short so I advise wait for it to go on sale", "timestamp_created": 1577818252, "timestamp_updated": 1577818252, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "60996774", "author": {"steamid": "76561198307713215", "personaname": "jumpingyahu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198307713215/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 77, "playtime_forever": 494, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 494, "last_played": 1577806503, "avatar": "31781a12dc7f6d276b9792fff18dc49b730b9ede"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good ♥♥♥♥. Abit clunky at times. Needs a harder mode and could have had more weapons and enemies. No melta ork :(\n\nStill this game is great and its dirt cheap on sale.